# Enterprise-licensed source. Neither is imported by CE (the client resolves
# every @/ee/* import to apps/client/src/ce/ee-stub, and the server's formula
# engine is packages/ce-formula), so keeping them out of the build context
# means no enterprise-licensed code enters the image at any layer.
apps/client/src/ee
packages/base-formula
packages/ee
